### vNext Monitor — GraphQL filter örnekleri
### ÖNEMLİ: filter bir JSON nesnesidir — `field op 'value'` string formu DEĞİL.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4203
@apiVersion = 1.0
@domain = core
@workflow = my-workflow-key

### Faulted instance'lar (modifiedAt'e göre azalan)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances?filter={"status":{"eq":"Faulted"}}&sort={"field":"modifiedAt","direction":"desc"}

### JSON data içinde arama (attributes)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances?filter={"attributes":{"category":{"eq":"finance"}}}

### Tarih aralığı + durum (mantıksal and)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances?filter={"and":[{"status":{"eq":"Active"}},{"createdAt":{"gt":"2026-06-08T00:00:00Z"}}]}

### İç içe JSON path
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances?filter={"attributes":{"payment":{"amount":{"ge":1000}}}}

### SLA aşımı — uzun süredir Active (createdAt eski)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances?filter={"and":[{"status":{"eq":"Active"}},{"createdAt":{"lt":"2026-06-08T00:00:00Z"}}]}

### Gruplama + sayma (yalnızca JSON data path üzerinde çalışır — instance column DEĞİL)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances?groupBy={"field":"attributes.category"}&aggregations={"count":true}
